      "notes_html": "<p>The BD/DD generators (<code class=\"k\">nexa bd create-*</code>, <code class=\"k\">nexa dd create-*</code>) now refuse to overwrite a document that is in customer review, approved or done. Since 3.8.0: <code class=\"k\">nexa tui --print</code> answers in about half the time, <code class=\"k\">nexa tui --trust-project</code> opens the chat directly when your API key is in the environment, and new projects use a free OpenRouter model that still exists. The BA skills now have <code class=\"k\">si-*</code> names; old names keep working, and <code class=\"k\">nexa profile sync</code> removes the old copies.</p>"
