      "notes_html": "<p>First NEXA Agent release: NEXA 3.8.0 with its own Node 22 runtime, installed with one command on macOS, Linux or Windows (preview), no npm or Node needed. NEXA 3.8.0 runs TUI sub-agents in parallel, with git worktree isolation for writing children and builtin <code class=\"k\">reviewer</code> and <code class=\"k\">worker</code> agents, makes the first TUI turn faster and adds the <code class=\"k\">prr</code>, <code class=\"k\">nexa-audit-readiness</code>, <code class=\"k\">pr-review</code> and <code class=\"k\">synca-playbook</code> skills.</p>"
